@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{socialLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@tagId = {{createTag.response.body.$.data.tagId}}

### 0. 소셜 로그인 (토큰 확보)
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-tag-test-001",
  "email": "tag.test@example.com",
  "name": "태그테스트"
}

### 1a. 태그 등록 (hashtag 필수·이후 불변, handle 선택)
# @name createTag
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hashtag": "royalcanin",
  "title": "로얄캐닌 어덜트",
  "handle": "royal_canin_01",
  "content": "강아지 사료",
  "link": "https://example.com/product/1",
  "imageFileIds": []
}

### 1b. 태그 등록 (단순 해시태그 — handle/title 없음)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hashtag": "산책"
}

### 2. 태그 정보 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. 태그 검색 (hashtag·title·handle 부분일치)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/search?q=royal&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. 태그 추천 (입력 중 접두/부분일치, q 없으면 인기순)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/recommend?q=roy&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. 태그 수정 — title/content/link (hashtag·handle 제외)
# (= clear* 플래그로 NULL 클리어 가능)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "로얄캐닌 어덜트 (수정)",
  "content": "중형견용",
  "link": "https://example.com/product/1-updated"
}

### 6. handle 변경 가능 여부
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/{{tagId}}/handle/change-availability
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. handle 변경/최초 설정 (설정·변경 후 30일 쿨다운 — 생성 시 handle 넣었으면 실패 예상)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/{{tagId}}/handle
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handle": "royal_canin_02"
}
